<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1725_6333.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnsernn</unclear> früntlichenn nachpürlichenn willenn und
<lb n="2"/>alles gutz zuvor. Edle frome ernnveste wÿse
<lb n="3"/>günstige liebe herrnn unnd nachpurnn. Üwer
<lb n="4"/>schrÿbenn habennnd wir empfanngenn, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innens</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begerrnn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefanngnen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hans</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Farenn</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstanndenn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daruff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habennd</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>wir gemelte unnsere burger für unns be-
<lb n="8"/>schÿdenn, unnd sÿ fragenn lassenn was unnd
<lb n="9"/>wievil gemelter <persName resp="#ner">Hans alhir</persName> für lÿnwath
<lb n="10"/>inenn erkoufft. Also habennd sÿ unns
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bÿligenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zedlenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bericht</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>gebenn, unnd sÿe ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söuliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lÿnwath</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nürnbergerr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stabenn</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>unnd das crütz
